### Feature Appointment — GET ALL / GET ONE
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1
@token = 
# @name getAllAppointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/citas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

